{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 9.516,
   "text": "On a road trip west, my sister and I stopped at a tiny motel in the middle of the desert."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 10.116,
   "end": 14.959,
   "text": "The night clerk handed us a key, an empty ice bucket... and one rule."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 15.759,
   "end": 20.431,
   "text": "If you hear the ice machine running after midnight... don't go out for ice."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 21.231,
   "end": 25.369,
   "text": "And if someone knocks with a full bucket... don't let them in."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 26.569,
   "end": 31.263,
   "text": "We laughed about it over vending machine snacks, then turned out the lights."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 32.163,
   "end": 36.792,
   "text": "At two a.m., a low, grinding hum woke me up. The ice machine."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 37.792,
   "end": 40.011,
   "text": "Then... a soft knock."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 42.611,
   "end": 45.896,
   "text": "\"Hey, it's me. Open up... I got us ice.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 46.896,
   "end": 50.523,
   "text": "It was my sister's voice. Right outside the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 51.523,
   "end": 55.213,
   "text": "I almost got up. Then I looked over at the other bed."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 56.213,
   "end": 60.075,
   "text": "My sister was right there... curled up, facing the wall."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 62.075,
   "end": 65.915,
   "text": "So I lay still, until the knocking finally stopped."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 67.115,
   "end": 72.149,
   "text": "In the morning, a bucket of ice sat outside our door... melting in the sun."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 73.749,
   "end": 80.213,
   "text": "Then the girl in my sister's bed rolled over, smiled... and whispered, \"Thanks for not letting her in.\""
  }
 ],
